WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.062 --> 00:00:10.760
Scalp mode: a one-tap pad for fast in-and-out trades.

2
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.322
Pick a size, then Arm. Disarmed, the buttons send nothing.

3
00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:22.760
Buy at ask: an immediate-or-cancel limit at the price on the button.

4
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.991
Bought 5. The acknowledgement says exactly what happened.

5
00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:28.990
Flatten closes the position in one tap.

6
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:32.029
Reverse doubles the exposure, so it is the only one that needs a hold.

7
00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:35.059
Reversed: now short 5. The pad disarms itself after 2 minutes idle.
